- RQ5 risks_addressed: safety, misuse or reliability risks the paper discusses
- RQ5 mitigations: guardrails or mitigations it proposes or uses
- author_limitations (verbatim): the authors' own limitations statement, verbatim, <=60 words
- author_future_work (verbatim): the authors' future-work statement, verbatim, <=60 words
- evidence (page/section): for the fields above, the section names or numbers where you found them
